  <name>Nova Engine</name>
  <developer id="github.com/sou-sand">
    <name>SouSand</name>
  </developer>
  <summary>A Psych Engine revival with features for VS Songs</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>Apache-2.0</project_license>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/sou-sand/fnf-nova-engine</url>
  <description>
    <p>Nova Engine is a revival of Psych Engine, originally used on VS Songs, with features tailored to that game. It preserves
      Psych Engine's modding and casual-play focus while adding customizable gameplay, chart and week editors, and updates to
      the original game's weeks. It is not intended to match current Friday Night Funkin', osu!lazer, or any other game.</p>
  </description>
